### ==========================================================
### 分类管理 — CRUD + 拖拽排序
### 先保证 {{token}} 在 env 中有效
### ==========================================================

### 1. 获取分类列表（注册后自动生成5个预置分类）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. 新增分类
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "鞋类"
}

### 3. 修改分类名称（把 id 换成实际值）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "裙装类"
}

### 4. 删除分类（分类下有商品会提示）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/categories/99
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 批量更新排序
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/categories/sort
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "sortOrder": 2
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "sortOrder": 1
  }
]
